# Joomla 5 — ignore everything, then re-add only what WE wrote.
#
# The official github/gitignore Joomla template enumerates core paths, but it dates from
# Joomla 3 (protostar, isis, hathor, fof) and rots with every release. Inverting it is
# release-proof: Joomla core is ~109 MB of vendor code that `joomla update` replaces
# wholesale, and nothing here is ever hand-edited. Re-download the matching Joomla version,
# drop these files in, restore the database — that is the whole recovery procedure.
#
# NEVER un-ignore configuration.php: it holds the DB credentials and $secret.

/*
!.gitignore

# --- our system plugin (revalidates the Next.js frontend on save)
!/plugins/
/plugins/*
!/plugins/system/
/plugins/system/*
!/plugins/system/nextrevalidate/

# --- our uploaded media, but none of Joomla's stock images
!/images/
/images/*
!/images/customers/
!/images/gallery/
!/images/logo.png
!/images/logo-footer.png
!/images/hero.jpg
